never has the right graphic tile (dogs seem to look like wolves, cats look like
lizards, etc). They ID as what they actually are when you "examine" them and
the game treats them as regular pets so I can mostly ignore the bug but it
can still be distracting for those who played Slash'em to play this Nethack
tourament and think they have a hellhound pup as a pet instead of a dog based
